From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mio <mio@mio19.uk>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 23:44:28 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] grant framebuffer/input access without udev
 (devices/fossil-hoki)

Set /dev/fb0 to root:video 0660 and /dev/input/event* to root:input 0660 with systemd-tmpfiles. udevd currently dies with EINVAL on this 4.14 kernel before its rules can run, so the launcher user cannot open the framebuffer or evdev nodes.
---
 devices/fossil-hoki/default.nix | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/devices/fossil-hoki/default.nix b/devices/fossil-hoki/default.nix
index ecdca7fd..81ca0ec8 100644
--- a/devices/fossil-hoki/default.nix
+++ b/devices/fossil-hoki/default.nix
@@ -205,6 +205,8 @@ in
   systemd.tmpfiles.rules = [
     "d /var/lib/environment/compositor 0755 root root -"
     "L+ /dev/graphics/fb0 - - - - /dev/fb0"
+    "z /dev/fb0 0660 root video -"
+    "z /dev/input/event* 0660 root input -"
     "d /mnt/vendor 0755 root root -"
     "L+ /mnt/vendor/persist - - - - /persist"
     "d /data/vendor 0755 root root -"
